MID_SE_Seo_Die_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_001: Haaah...
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_002: I feel so...helpless. There's nothing I can do\nfor Orchel.
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_003: I'm not smart like Credna. What good is a bodyguard\nwho lost the one he's supposed to protect?
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_004: Ngh!
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_005: A child should have been able to dodge that.
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_006: Theodora? Were you following me?
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_007: You have been wandering about forlorn, night after\nnight. I came to find out why.
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_008: A distracted warrior is a liability on the battlefield.
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_009: This is not to say I am ungrateful that you joined\nour cause, mind you.
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_010: We can never have enough allies to fend off Dagda\nthe Great. Still...
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_011: Diego! Are you listening to me?
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_012: You shouldn't care about me. Not after I tried to...
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_013: Hmp. Did you think I was unaware that you fought\nalongside Bahr Vahn?
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_014: You knew? Then are you here to sentence me\nto death?
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_015: Simpleton. If that were my intent, I would have\ncarried it out long ago.
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_016: I lost an arm because at the time, I was no match for\na superior warrior.
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_017: But if you are offering your head for free, I may yet\ntake you up on it.
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_018: I have to survive if I ever hope to be reunited.
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_019: So even if I'm helpless and good for nothing, I have\nto stay alive for that.
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_020: If you want my arm, it's yours. But I need to hold on\nto my life.
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_021: Good. If you can grasp that much, then all is well.
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_022: I want that brooding expression gone from your face\nby the morning, or I really shall execute you.
MID_SE_Seo_Die_C_023: I see now. I know what I can do...
